<div class="email email-first">

    <div id="J5ZRRQ2EQRVIFF7LL23TWMTL4AVCLYNZ" class="email-header">
        <div class="gravatar-wrapper d-flex">
            <div class="gravatar circle">
                <img class="gravatar" src="https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/17724e30a0f1e0ee8310d25d47c8adad.jpg?s=120&amp;d=mm&amp;r=g" width="120" height="120" alt="" />
            </div>
            <div class="email-author d-flex">
                <h2 class="name">
                    
                       Александр Артамохов
                    
                </h2>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="email-date right">
            
            
            <span class="date d-none d-sm-inline">
                30 Oct
                
                    2026
                
            </span>
            <span class="date d-sm-none">
                30 Oct
                
                '26
                
            </span>
            
            <div class="time">
                <span title="Sender's time: Oct. 30, 2026, 9:51 a.m.">10:51 a.m.</span>
            </div>

        </div>
        
    </div> <!-- /email-header: gravatar, author-info, date, peramlink, changed_subject -->
    <div class="email-body ">
      <p>Hello, I would like to request that HISTOR's log be added to the staging witness network, on the 10qps list. vkey histor.modelmarket.dev/log+ad3ca066+AfXpkWqXVW93sChXnhKsNzvGLTFAAredl1jLlEjbr4wU qpd 144 contact alexar76@rambler.ru Origin line: histor.modelmarket.dev/log (equal to the vkey key name). Key type 0x01, Ed25519. Checkpoint: <a target="_blank" href="https://histor.modelmarket.dev/checkpoint">https://histor.modelmarket.dev/checkpoint</a> <a target="_blank" href="https://histor.modelmarket.dev/checkpoint">https://histor.modelmarket.dev/checkpoint</a> Add-checkpoint rate: one request per witness every 10 minutes (144 per day), from a timer on the log's host. The log only grows; consistency proofs are served at <a target="_blank" href="https://histor.modelmarket.dev/api/v1/log/proof/consistency?first=&amp;second=">https://histor.modelmarket.dev/api/v1/log/proof/consistency?first=&second=</a> <a target="_blank" href="https://histor.modelmarket.dev/api/v1/log/proof/consistency?first=&amp;second=">https://histor.modelmarket.dev/api/v1/log/proof/consistency?first=&second=</a> and the witness client handles 409 by resubmitting from the witness's size. What it is: HISTOR is a public, append-only log of the tool definitions that MCP (Model Context Protocol) servers listed in the official MCP registry actually serve. Each observation becomes a signed statement, and the statements are leaves of an RFC 9162 Merkle tree (currently about 1.29 million leaves, growing by a few thousand a day). The format is specified at <a target="_blank" href="https://github.com/alexar76/histor/blob/main/docs/spec/transparency-log.md">https://github.com/alexar76/histor/blob/main/docs/spec/transparency-log.md</a> <a target="_blank" href="https://github.com/alexar76/histor/blob/main/docs/spec/transparency-log.md">https://github.com/alexar76/histor/blob/main/docs/spec/transparency-log.md</a> with test vectors; the checkpoint and note formats were checked byte for byte against golang.org/x/mod/sumdb/note and github.com/transparency-dev/formats/note. Intended users: MCP clients and security tooling that want to check whether the tool definitions they received are the ones the server serves to everyone (split-view detection for tool definitions), and researchers using the weekly open dataset (doi:10.5281/zenodo.23512759). Witness cosignatures are what would turn the log's own signed heads into evidence that it shows everyone the same tree. Load versus utility: 144 add-checkpoint requests per witness per day, small checkpoints, no burst. Expected lifetime: long-lived; the log has run since September 2026 and the origin and key will not change. The same instance also implements c2sp.org/tlog-witness <a target="_blank" href="https://histor.modelmarket.dev/witness/v1">https://histor.modelmarket.dev/witness/v1</a>, <a target="_blank" href="https://histor.modelmarket.dev/witness/v1">https://histor.modelmarket.dev/witness/v1</a>, key histor.modelmarket.dev/witness+87df9f83+BHmgo3SRWlaehFMgWBDIOWFgs1V2YQS+ufBcg/ht6kw/). It is not offered as a network witness yet; if that would be useful once it has run for a while, I would be glad to discuss it separately. Thank you, Aleksandr Artamokhov</p>

    </div>

    
